<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;">
<p>Hi {{ candidateName }},</p>
<p>Thank you for applying for <strong>{{ jobTitle }}</strong> at {{ organizationName }}. We will not be taking your application further.</p>
<p>The reason: {{ reason }}</p>
<p>This decision was made automatically from your answer to a screening question. If you think it is wrong, contact the hiring team at {{ organizationName }} and a person will review your application.</p>
<p>{{ organizationName }}</p>
</body>
</html>
